From: Y2Linux
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec: H.264 and MPEG-4 on the Innioasis Y2 hardware decoder (/dev/y2-vdec)

FFmpeg parses and keeps the references; the kernel driver (Y2Linux kernel/platform/vdec.c)
programs the MT6582 decoder, one call per picture. H.264: 4:2:0 8-bit streams, frames and fields.
MPEG-4 Part 2: progressive, without sprites and data partitioning. The rest stays in software.
libavcodec/y2_vdec_uapi.h is a copy of kernel/platform/y2-vdec.h.
---
